<p>Founder of Vault Human. For over twenty years Russ has led organizations &mdash; as a CEO, Executive Director, and Board President, and as an attorney, still practicing. He speaks as an operator and a builder, not a theorist: someone who has raised capital, run teams, and stood with people through the decisions that constitute a life.</p>
